[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0103","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16167","title":"JPCERTCC LogonTracer upload 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"LogonTracer 1.2.0 及之前版本存在 OS 命令注入漏洞，攻击者可通过向 /upload 接口发送特制请求，在未经身份认证的情况下远程执行任意系统命令。该漏洞源于程序未对用户上传的文件名参数进行有效过滤，导致攻击者可注入恶意命令。CVSS 评分 9.8，攻击复杂度低，无需权限和用户交互，可完全控制目标服务器。JPCERTCC 已在 v1.2.1 中修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16167"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-01-09T23:29:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:43:48Z","remediation":"立即升级 LogonTracer 至 v1.2.1 或更高版本（https://github.com/JPCERTCC/LogonTracer/releases/tag/v1.2.1）。该版本修复了 upload 功能中未对用户输入做充分过滤导致的 OS 命令注入问题。如无法升级，建议限制对 /upload 路径的外部访问，仅允许受信任内网 IP 访问 Web 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/JPCERTCC/LogonTracer/releases/tag/v1.2.1","https://jvn.jp/en/vu/JVNVU98026636/index.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49918","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16167.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-16167.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2018/CVE-2018-16167.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16167.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-16167.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-16167-3360.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-16167-3359.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-16167/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2018-16167.py","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/LogonTracer/CVE-2018-16167.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16167.py","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-16167.yaml","https://github.com/dnr6419/CVE-2018-16167"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0103.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0103.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0131","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0131.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-18264","title":"Kubernetes Dashboard 身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"Kubernetes Dashboard 在 1.10.1 版本之前存在身份验证绕过漏洞（CWE-306）。由于 Dashboard 未对关键功能实施有效的身份验证检查，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接访问 Dashboard 的 Service Account 凭据，进而读取集群内的敏感 Secret 信息。攻击者无需任何权限，仅需网络可达目标 Kubernetes Dashboard 服务即可触发。该漏洞影响所有低于 1.10.1 的 Kubernetes Dashboard 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 v1.10.1 版本中通过 PR #3289 和 #3400 修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-18264"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-01-03T01:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:46:55Z","remediation":"立即升级 Kubernetes Dashboard 至 v1.10.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了默认 Service Account 的权限绕过问题。如无法立即升级，可通过 RBAC 限制 kubernetes-dashboard  Service Account 的权限，仅授予必要的最小权限，并禁用 Dashboard 的匿名访问。同时建议在集群入口处配置网络策略或反向代理认证，限制对 Dashboard 服务的直接访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106493","https://github.com/kubernetes/dashboard/pull/3289","https://github.com/kubernetes/dashboard/pull/3400","https://github.com/kubernetes/dashboard/releases/tag/v1.10.1","https://groups.google.com/forum/#%21topic/kubernetes-announce/yBrFf5nmvfI","https://sysdig.com/blog/privilege-escalation-kubernetes-dashboard/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18264.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-18264.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2018/CVE-2018-18264.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/470882de1d838c0314a2db2fc03b1761bf6b881f/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18264.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-18264.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-18264-3435.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-18264-3433.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-18264-3431.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Google Kubernetes/CVE-2018-18264.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/medbsq/templates/CVE-2018-18264.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/ARPSyndicate/jaeles/cvescan/high/CVE-2018-18264.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0131.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0131.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0131.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0166","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0166.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-20608","title":"imcat 4.4 信息泄露漏洞","description":"imcat 4.4 存在敏感信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过直接访问 `root/tools/adbug/binfo.php?phpinfo1` 路径获取服务器 PHP 配置信息（phpinfo），该页面未进行任何身份验证或访问控制。phpinfo 输出中包含了服务器环境变量、系统路径、已安装的 PHP 扩展及版本等敏感信息，攻击者可利用这些信息进一步探测服务器配置弱点，为后续攻击提供情报支撑。攻击条件简单，无需任何权限，仅需目标系统运行 imcat 4.4 且该调试页面未被删除或限制访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-20608"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-30T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:53:10Z","remediation":"立即删除或限制访问 `root/tools/adbug/binfo.php` 文件，该调试脚本不应存在于生产环境。升级 imcat 至最新版本（4.4 之后已修复此问题）。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）配置中添加规则拒绝访问 `/tools/adbug/` 路径，或移除整个 `tools/adbug/` 目录。同时禁用生产环境中的 `phpinfo()` 函数（在 php.ini 中将 `disable_functions` 加入 `phpinfo`）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/AvaterXXX/CVEs/blob/master/imcat.md#information-disclosure","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20608.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-20608.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20608.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-20608.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2018/20xxx/CVE-2018-20608.json","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-20608.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/txjia/imcat/CVE-2018-20608.yaml","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web安全/Imcat/ （CVE-2018-20608）Imcat 4.4 敏感信息泄露 .md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-20608.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-20608.md","https://github.com/nosafer/nosafer.github.io/blob/1b07659147a7781a61e0b950684ad8d7739fadbd/docs/Web安全/Imcat/ （CVE-2018-20608）Imcat 4.4 敏感信息泄露 .md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0166.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0163","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0163.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-20463","title":"WordPress JSmol2WP 插件目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 JSmol2WP 插件 1.07 版本中存在任意文件读取漏洞，攻击者可通过 jsmol.php 的 query 参数传入 `php://filter/resource=../` 目录遍历序列，读取服务器上任意文件。该漏洞还可被用于服务端请求伪造（SSRF）攻击。攻击无需身份认证，可远程利用，导致敏感信息泄露。建议升级插件至最新版本或禁用该插件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-20463"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-25T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:52:53Z","remediation":"立即停用 JSmol2WP 插件并升级到最新版本（若官方已修复）；如无安全版本，直接删除该插件。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器（如 Nginx/Apache）配置中禁用对 `jsmol.php` 的 `query` 参数的 `php://` 流访问，或限制 `jsmol.php` 的 URL 访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9197","https://www.cbiu.cc/2018/12/WordPress%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6jsmol2wp%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/#%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96-amp-SSRF","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20463.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-20463.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2018/CVE-2018-20463.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20463.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-20463.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2018/20xxx/CVE-2018-20463.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/ed3533775a9ade21f1577e57c130e65e8f80898c/2018/CVE-2018-20463.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-20463.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-20463/poc/nuclei/CVE-2018-20463.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/23441ec855d45e03157b693d7c6d0ff023fe3af5/2018/CVE-2018-20463/README.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2018-20463.yaml","https://github.com/Henry4E36/CVE-2018-20463"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0163.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0162","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0162.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-20462","title":"WordPress JSmol2WP Plugin 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"JSmol2WP WordPress 插件 1.07 版本中的 jsmol.php 文件存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞，攻击者可通过 data 参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码。当用户访问特制链接时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持等危害。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互点击链接，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-20462"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-25T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:52:53Z","remediation":"立即在 WordPress 后台停用并删除 JSmol2WP 插件 1.07 版本，该插件已因安全漏洞被官方关闭且不再维护。如必须使用 JSmol2WP 功能，可改用其他活跃维护的分子结构可视化替代插件（如 MolView 或 ChemDoodle），并在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中添加规则过滤 jsmol.php 的 data 参数中的恶意 HTML/JavaScript 负载作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9196","https://www.cbiu.cc/2018/12/WordPress%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6jsmol2wp%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/#%E5%8F%8D%E5%B0%84%E6%80%A7XSS","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20462.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-20462.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20462.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-20462.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-20462-3494.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-20462-3492.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-20462.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2018-20462.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2018/20xxx/CVE-2018-20462.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-20462.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20462.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0162.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0520","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19323","title":"技嘉 GIGABYTE APP Center 等多款产品 权限提升漏洞","description":"这是一个涉及 GIGABYTE多款产品中的GDrv低级驱动程序的安全漏洞，该驱动程序在APP Center、AORUS GRAPHICS ENGINE、XTREME GAMING ENGINE和OC GURU II等软件版本中暴露了读取和写入处理器特定寄存器（Machine Specific Registers，MSR）的功能。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过访问这些受保护的MSR寄存器，从而绕过系统安全控制，获取更高的系统权限或执行恶意代码，进而完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响Windows平台多款GIGABYTE产品，CVSS评分高达9.8，属于严重安全漏洞。攻击者无需任何特殊条件即可远程触发，危险性极高。GIGABYTE已经发布了安全补丁，用户应及时更新到最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19323"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-12-21T23:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:49:08Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 GIGABYTE 相关软件到修复版本：GIGABYTE APP Center 升级至 v1.05.22 或更高版本，AORUS GRAPHICS ENGINE 升级至 v1.57 或更高版本，XTREME GAMING ENGINE 升级至 v1.26 或更高版本，OC GURU II 升级至 v2.09 或更高版本。若无法立即升级，建议卸载受影响的 GIGABYTE 软件套件（APP Center、AORUS ENGINE、XTREME ENGINE、OC GURU II），并在设备管理器中禁用 GDrv 驱动程序（GDrv.sys），或在 BIOS 中禁用相关驱动加载选项作为临时缓解措施。请访问 GIGABYTE 官网支持页面下载对应产品的最新版本驱动与工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Dec/39","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106252","https://www.gigabyte.com/Support/Security/1801","https://www.gigabyte.com/tw/Support/Utility/Graphics-Card","https://www.secureauth.com/labs/advisories/gigabyte-drivers-elevation-privilege-vulnerabilities","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-19323","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-19323.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/bed70a0a2e2dec8bd34bd440f68f32280391094f/2018/CVE-2018-19323.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19323.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/617f5713eaf60aa312a8e3fe5c9942eeb7cf98ee/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19323.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/6e3267700a6a68d4b849c870d5c00c67dc46e86a/data/by-cve/CVE-2018-19323.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/6a32bab1b63e302ab8a4aae06190853195172067/2018/CVE-2018-19323.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-19323.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/6e3267700a6a68d4b849c870d5c00c67dc46e86a/data/2018/CVE-2018-19323-blueisbeautiful_CVE-2018-19323.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-19323.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-19323.json","https://github.com/blueisbeautiful/CVE-2018-19323"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0015","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19322","title":"GIGABYTE 驱动程序 IO端口读写漏洞","description":"tags.<value>GIGABYTE APP Center v1.05.21及更早版本、AORUS GRAPHICS ENGINE 1.57之前版本、XTREME GAMING ENGINE 1.26之前版本以及OC GURU II v2.08中的GPCIDrv和GDrv底层驱动程序暴露了读写IO端口的功能。攻击者可利用此漏洞向目标系统发送特制的数据，通过IO端口读写操作实现权限提升，最终在目标设备上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响上述所有GIGABYTE产品版本，CVSS评分为7.8（高危），攻击条件为攻击者需具备对目标系统的本地访问权限或已获得一定级别的系统访问。GIGABYTE已发布更新版本修复此漏洞，用户应升级至最新版本以消除风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19322"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-12-21T23:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:49:07Z","remediation":"立即升级GIGABYTE APP Center至v1.05.22或更高版本，AORUS GRAPHICS ENGINE至v1.57或更高版本，XTREME GAMING ENGINE至v1.26或更高版本，OC GURU II至v2.09或更高版本。若无法立即升级，可禁用GPCIDrv和GDrv驱动的IO端口访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Dec/39","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106252","https://www.gigabyte.com/Support/Security/1801","https://www.gigabyte.com/tw/Support/Utility/Graphics-Card","https://www.secureauth.com/labs/advisories/gigabyte-drivers-elevation-privilege-vulnerabilities","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-19322","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-19322.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19322.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/617f5713eaf60aa312a8e3fe5c9942eeb7cf98ee/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19322.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-19322.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-19322.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-19322.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-19322.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-19322.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-19322.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-19322.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0014","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19321","title":"技嘉 多款产品 权限提升漏洞","description":"技嘉多款产品的 GPCIDrv 和 GDrv 低级驱动程序存在权限许可和访问控制缺陷，暴露了读写任意物理内存的功能接口。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞通过调用驱动程序提供的 IOCTL 接口，实现对内核内存的任意读写，从而绕过安全机制提升权限至 SYSTEM 级别。受影响产品包括 GIGABYTE APP Center v1.05.21 及更早版本、AORUS GRAPHICS ENGINE 1.57 之前版本、XTREME GAMING ENGINE 1.26 之前版本以及 OC GURU II v2.08。攻击条件为本地访问权限且无需用户交互，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8（HIGH），向量为 CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19321"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-12-21T23:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:49:06Z","remediation":"立即将 GIGABYTE APP Center 升级至 19.0422.1 或更高版本，AORUS GRAPHICS ENGINE 升级至 1.57 或更高版本，XTREME GAMING ENGINE 升级至 1.26 或更高版本。上述驱动驱动程序存在任意物理内存读写漏洞，本地攻击者可利用其提升至 SYSTEM 权限。如无法立即更新，建议卸载受影响驱动程序或通过组策略限制非管理员用户加载 GPCIDrv.sys 和 GDrv.sys 驱动。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Dec/39","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106252","https://www.gigabyte.com/Support/Security/1801","https://www.secureauth.com/labs/advisories/gigabyte-drivers-elevation-privilege-vulnerabilities","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-19321","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-19321.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/bed70a0a2e2dec8bd34bd440f68f32280391094f/2018/CVE-2018-19321.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19321.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/617f5713eaf60aa312a8e3fe5c9942eeb7cf98ee/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19321.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/6a32bab1b63e302ab8a4aae06190853195172067/2018/CVE-2018-19321.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-19321.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-19321.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-19321.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-19321.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-19321.json","https://github.com/nanabingies/Driver-RW","https://github.com/nanabingies/CVE-2018-19321"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0014.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0013","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19320","title":"技嘉 APP Center / AORUS GRAPHICS ENGINE / XTREME GAMING ENGINE / OC GURU II 驱动程序本地权限提升漏洞","description":"技嘉（GIGABYTE）多款产品中的 GDrv 底层驱动程序（gdrv.sys）存在权限访问控制缺陷。该驱动暴露了 ring0 级别的 memcpy 类似功能，允许具有低权限的本地攻击者通过 DeviceIoControl 调用 IOCTL 0xC3502808 向内核内存任意写入数据，进而覆盖 HalDispatchTable 指针劫持执行流，注入令牌窃取 shellcode 实现权限提升至 SYSTEM。该漏洞影响 GIGABYTE APP Center v1.05.21 及更早版本、AORUS GRAPHICS ENGINE 1.57 之前版本、XTREME GAMING ENGINE 1.26 之前版本及 OC GURU II v2.08。攻击者只需本地低权限账户即可完成利用，无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），存在在野利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19320"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-12-21T23:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:49:06Z","remediation":"立即将 GIGABYTE APP Center 升级至 19.0422.1 或更高版本，AORUS GRAPHICS ENGINE 升级至 1.57 或更高版本，XTREME GAMING ENGINE 升级至 1.26 或更高版本，卸载 OC GURU II v2.08。如无法更新，建议禁用 GDrv 驱动加载或移除相关设备的驱动程序权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Dec/39","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106252","https://www.gigabyte.com/Support/Security/1801","https://www.gigabyte.com/tw/Support/Utility/Graphics-Card","https://www.secureauth.com/labs/advisories/gigabyte-drivers-elevation-privilege-vulnerabilities","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-19320","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-19320.md","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/26f8800d4b98f2455904765dcbab38cc96f3a655/archive/gmh5225/CVE-2018-19320-LPE.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/bed70a0a2e2dec8bd34bd440f68f32280391094f/2018/CVE-2018-19320.json","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/26f8800d4b98f2455904765dcbab38cc96f3a655/archive/gmh5225/CVE-2018-19320.txt","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/26f8800d4b98f2455904765dcbab38cc96f3a655/description/gmh5225/CVE-2018-19320/description_ko.txt","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/26f8800d4b98f2455904765dcbab38cc96f3a655/description/gmh5225/CVE-2018-19320/description_es.txt","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/26f8800d4b98f2455904765dcbab38cc96f3a655/description/gmh5225/CVE-2018-19320/description_de.txt","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/26f8800d4b98f2455904765dcbab38cc96f3a655/description/gmh5225/CVE-2018-19320/description_it.txt","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/26f8800d4b98f2455904765dcbab38cc96f3a655/description/gmh5225/CVE-2018-19320/description_ja.txt","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/26f8800d4b98f2455904765dcbab38cc96f3a655/description/gmh5225/CVE-2018-19320/description_ru.txt","https://github.com/zer0condition/GDRVLoader","https://github.com/ASkyeye/CVE-2018-19320","https://github.com/hmnthabit/CVE-2018-19320-LPE"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0125","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0125.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-17246","title":"Elastic Kibana 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"Kibana Console 插件存在任意文件包含漏洞，攻击者通过 Kibana Console API 发送特制请求可触发 JavaScript 代码执行，进而导致以 Kibana 进程权限在主机系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Kibana 6.4.3 之前及 5.6.13 之前的版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。用户需升级至 Kibana 6.4.3 或 5.6.13 及以上版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-17246"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-20T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:45:35Z","remediation":"立即升级 Kibana 至 6.4.3 或 5.6.13 及以上版本。如无法升级，在 kibana.yml 中设置 console.enabled: false 禁用 Console 插件并重启服务，或在反向代理层限制 /api/console/api_server 路径的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106285","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2018:3743","https://discuss.elastic.co/t/elastic-stack-6-4-3-and-5-6-13-security-update/155594","https://www.elastic.co/community/security","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17246.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-17246.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/kibana/CVE-2018-17246/README.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/kibana/CVE-2018-17246/README.zh-cn.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2018/CVE-2018-17246.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2018/CVE-2018-17246.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4364d39380ee5ce53a0ba00a4a1f4a27f1df9cc8/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-17246.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/Web应用漏洞/Kibana 本地文件包含漏洞 CVE-2018-17246.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-17246.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-17246-3414.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-17246-3411.yaml","https://github.com/mpgn/CVE-2018-17246","https://github.com/Almandev/Sub-folderFetcher"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0125.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0028","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-1000856","title":"DomainMOD DomainMOD 跨站脚本 (XSS) 漏洞","description":"该漏洞属于存储型跨站脚本攻击（XSS）。DomainMOD 4.09.03 及以上版本（含 4.11.01）在“segments”页面的“Segment Name”字段中缺乏足够的输入过滤和输出编码。攻击者在拥有高权限的情况下，可以通过在段名称中注入恶意的 HTML 或 JavaScript 代码，使得任何访问该受影响页面的用户在浏览器中执行任意脚本。该漏洞影响 DomainMOD 4.09.03 及更高版本，攻击条件为受害者访问被注入的页面，可导致敏感信息泄露或账户被劫持。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-1000856"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-20T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:33:11Z","remediation":"由于官方尚未发布针对此漏洞的正式补丁版本，建议管理员通过在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）中配置对 Segment Name 字段的输入过滤规则来拦截恶意脚本。同时，建议开发者在代码层面对用户输入的 Segment Name 进行严格的 HTML 编码转义，确保所有输出至浏览器的内容均经过安全处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/domainmod/domainmod/issues/80","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1000856.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-1000856.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-1000856.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6