["CVE-2018-19439"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-13T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:49:18Z","remediation":"升级 Oracle Secure Global Desktop 至 5.4 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 5.4 版本中修复。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层面限制对 `/sgdadmin/faces/com_sun_web_ui/help/helpwindow.jsp` 路径的访问，仅允许受信任管理 IP 访问管理控制台，并对所有输入参数进行 HTML 编码输出以缓解 XSS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/150444/Oracle-Secure-Global-Desktop-Administration-Console-4.4-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Nov/58","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106006","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19439.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-19439.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19439.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-19439.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-19439-3480.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-19439-3474.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-19439-3479.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-19439-3475.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-19439-3478.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/high/CVE-2018-19439.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19439.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0148.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0212","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0212.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8033","title":"Apache OFBiz XXE漏洞","description":"Apache OFBiz 的 HTTP 引擎（`/webtools/control/httpService` 端点）在处理 XML 请求时未禁用外部实体解析，存在 XML 外部实体注入（XXE）漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向该端点发送包含恶意 DOCTYPE 声明的 POST 或 GET 请求，利用 `serviceName`、`serviceMode`、`serviceContext` 三个参数触发外部实体引用，从而读取服务器上的任意敏感文件（如配置文件、密码等），导致机密信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Apache OFBiz 16.11.01 至 16.11.04 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，无需任何权限或用户交互即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8033"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-12-13T14:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:04:08Z","remediation":"升级 Apache OFBiz 至 16.11.05 或更高版本（官方已在该版本中修复 XXE 问题），建议直接升级至最新稳定版 24.09.07。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或防火墙层面限制对 `/webtools/control/httpService` 端点的外部访问，仅允许可信 IP 调用该接口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/e8fb551e86e901932081f81ee9985bb72052b4d412f23d89b1282777%40%3Cuser.ofbiz.apache.org%3E","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8033.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-8033.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/ab6f9d01ebd789d88d6c9c80d2c4801a89e1f38f/2018/CVE-2018-8033.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8033.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-8033.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-8033-3634.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-8033-3632.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-8033-3635.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-8033-3636.yaml","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/ofbiz/CVE-2018-8033.md","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/apache-ofbiz-cve-2018-8033-xxe.yml","https://github.com/jamieparfet/Apache-OFBiz-XXE","https://github.com/Cappricio-Securities/CVE-2018-8033"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0212.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-1198","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-1198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8639","title":"Microsoft Windows Win32k 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Win32k 组件存在特权提升漏洞，由于在内存中处理对象时未能正确释放资源，导致对象引用计数错误（CWE-404）。攻击者在已获得目标系统低权限执行权限后，可通过特制构造的数据触发该漏洞，将进程权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别，完全控制受影响的系统。该漏洞影响 Windows 7、Windows 8.1、Windows 10、Windows RT 8.1 以及 Windows Server 2008、Windows Server 2008 R2、Windows Server 2012、Windows Server 2012 R2、Windows Server 2016、Windows Server 2019 等多个版本。Microsoft 已在 2018 年 12 月发布的安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8639"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-12-12T00:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:05:14Z","remediation":"建议立即安装微软 2018 年 12 月发布的累积更新（Cumulative Update），通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从微软官方更新目录下载对应的 KB 补丁包。对于无法立即更新的系统，建议通过限制低权限用户的 Win32k 句柄访问权限来减轻风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106093","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2018-8639","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-8639","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-8639.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d808dcfadcd0a0911218bbebd828dbae55c16a3e/2018/CVE-2018-8639.js